sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Tracker
  participant R as Re-ID manager (memory)
  participant C as Cloud compare API
  participant B as Browser
  T->>R: session N starts
  alt no reference face / cooldown
    R-->>B: handoff: new conversation (no call)
  else references exist
    R->>R: wait for a clear face<br/>(≤ reid_face_wait 3 s after participant appears)
    R->>C: compare(reference crop, current crop)
    C-->>R: score 0..1
    alt score ≥ 0.9
      R-->>B: handoff: resume (same conversation_id)
    else 0.4 ≤ score < 0.9
      R->>C: one retry with a fresh frame
      C-->>R: score
      R-->>B: resume if ≥ 0.9, else new conversation
    else score < 0.4, error, timeout (10 s)
      R-->>B: handoff: new conversation
    end
  end
  Note over R: best crop of this session becomes<br/>a reference when it ends (TTL ≤ 10 min)
